<title>CHINA: Hopewell eases on Thai, China uncertainty.</title>
<headline>Hopewell eases on Thai, China uncertainty.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Hopewell Holdings Ltd slipped in Friday morning trade, prompted by renewed concerns over the outlook of the company's infrastructural development projects in Thailand and China, brokers said.</p>
<p>Hopewell fell HK$0.10, or 2.11 percent, to HK$4.75 but on low turnover of HK$71 million.</p>
<p>&quot;The company is involved in infrastructure and the stakes are very high, and in China, for example, income has been below expectations,&quot; said Peter Lai, associate director at OCBC Securities.</p>
